ies of  everything that have come across all of  our collective consciousness on this  channel and in other places around the  web  what i would like to do is assay and  test the veracity of different models of  cosmogenesis the origin of the universe  origins of structure of space-time and  matter and in so doing i want to take  you along for a ride so i call this  project the assayer project doing what  galileo did 400 years ago not as good as  him but i'll do my best to use the tools  and technology of modern experimental  physics and astronomy to test whether or  not these new theories these new models  these new claims are truly worthy of our  attention so come along with me on what  i call this magical ride taking back to  what el maestro galileo did 400 years  ago in a magnificent book called the  sagittarii the assayer
 

